tered metal road case wrapped in heavy chains and covered in stickers and band decals.\n\nIn her right hand she grips a massive medieval war scythe, its long wooden shaft wrapped in leather, the enormous curved blade arcing dramatically over her head. Perched on her left fist, talons gripping her knuckles, is a majestic American bald eagle with pristine white head feathers and a sharp yellow beak, staring off to the side with predatory alertness.\n\nStudio lighting is hard and theatrical, casting crisp shadows. The composition is symmetrical, iconic, and poster-like — punk rock goddess of war meets American mythology. Hyperrealistic, high-fashion photography, 8k, sharp detail, magazine cover quality."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 72, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 119, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [480, 420], "pos": [578.2764282226562, -391.0182800292969], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [77], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [320, 170], "pos": [653.5697021484375, 192.02410888671875], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 98, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 99, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_con